{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00542","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 舒和 · 何鸾","name":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 舒和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乐奏云阕，礼章载虔。\n禋宗於地，昭假於天。\n惟馨荐矣，既醉歆焉。\n神之降福，永永万年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何鸾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}